Single-database Alembic environment for the Executor PostgreSQL schema.

Revision `0001` is the complete schema baseline recorded on 2026-08-31 and the only current
revision. It includes durable Execution events and replaces all previous development migrations,
including the former compatibility bridge. Databases created before this reset must be recreated,
even if they were stamped `0001`. Do not stamp an old database to bypass schema creation.

Create or verify a database with:

    uv run alembic upgrade head
    uv run alembic current
    uv run alembic check

Service startup never runs Alembic automatically. Run it as a release/init job before starting
Executor processes.
